---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const YEAR = 2026;
---

<footer class="border-t border-line bg-obsidian">
  <div class="container-wide grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-6 gap-y-12 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <img src={`${base}/favicon.svg`} alt="" width="40" height="40" class="h-10 w-10" />
        <p class="eyebrow text-cream">Forty Years of Transformation</p>
      </div>
      <p class="body-copy mt-6 max-w-[44ch] text-[0.95rem] text-mist">
        A commemorative national record marking four decades of nation-building in the Republic
        of Uganda · 1986–2026. A living archive, expandable through the anniversary year.
      </p>
      <p class="stamp mt-8 text-mist/70">“Not a mere change of guard — a fundamental change.”</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="col-span-6 md:col-span-2 md:col-start-7" aria-label="Explore the chapters">
      <h2 class="stamp text-gold">Explore</h2>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">
        <li><a href={`${base}/#inheritance`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">The Inheritance</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/#ledger`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">The Numbers</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/#journey`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">The Journey</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/#achievements`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">Achievements</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/#regions`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">The Regions</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <nav class="col-span-6 md:col-span-2" aria-label="More of the record">
      <h2 class="stamp text-gold">More</h2>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">
        <li><a href={`${base}/#voices`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">Voices</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/#pictures`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">In Pictures</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/#next`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">What’s Next</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/downloads`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">Downloads</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <nav class="col-span-12 md:col-span-3" aria-label="About this record">
      <h2 class="stamp text-gold">The Record</h2>
      <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">
        <li><a href={`${base}/sources`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">Sources & methodology</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${base}/accessibility`} class="stamp text-mist-bright hover:text-gold-hi">Accessibility & languages</a></li>
        <li>
          <span class="stamp text-mist" aria-label="Available in English; Luganda and Swahili in preparation">
            <span class="text-gold">EN</span> · LG · SW <span class="text-mist/60">(in preparation)</span>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="stamp text-mist/80">Privacy-first: no cookies, no cross-site tracking.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-line">
    <div class="container-wide flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 py-6">
      <p class="stamp text-mist/70">© {YEAR} Republic of Uganda · State House</p>
      <p class="stamp text-mist/70">The record continues.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
